[{:db/id "q-20145/selection/abe476e447976564bc5c670fe73789666287b967d49bbed12b1d85144449e63e" :answer/id #uuid "43525099-f7a5-5795-9865-fb028757b5de" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "23" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-20145/selection/0fbe558572ecce67593db00d22f0d8d9d09c98d019451cd13488790a441e6c9c" :answer/id #uuid "bb6ce8cf-b22f-5b84-af3d-ab897274d45c" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "20" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-20145/selection/ebe3072a1dd0240f82f7c04e06603ef971401ed1aea6a421c38664ef5adb09f3" :answer/id #uuid "96f03684-5013-5a9a-aafd-6c9fa4546707" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "29" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-20145/selection/f345fac9a81ccd096b9959c6e7a966a446e93e73b82d111a376f9064132509fd" :answer/id #uuid "861b252a-74fc-5f26-a6fd-485388cfb322" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "24" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-20145/selection/96ee6a3361e9d457b88fc124f1f022ef8dc27c2272728293b480cef1fc3f4e34" :answer/id #uuid "f9940d43-9fe4-5521-b22e-f21603bb7c88" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "\\frac{21}{2}" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-20145/selection" :answer-field/id #uuid "54d7e4c2-b00e-5450-a3fb-08e3c871117f" :answer-field/key "selection" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/radio :answer-field/correct "q-20145/selection/0fbe558572ecce67593db00d22f0d8d9d09c98d019451cd13488790a441e6c9c" :answer-field/choices ["q-20145/selection/abe476e447976564bc5c670fe73789666287b967d49bbed12b1d85144449e63e" "q-20145/selection/0fbe558572ecce67593db00d22f0d8d9d09c98d019451cd13488790a441e6c9c" "q-20145/selection/ebe3072a1dd0240f82f7c04e06603ef971401ed1aea6a421c38664ef5adb09f3" "q-20145/selection/f345fac9a81ccd096b9959c6e7a966a446e93e73b82d111a376f9064132509fd" "q-20145/selection/96ee6a3361e9d457b88fc124f1f022ef8dc27c2272728293b480cef1fc3f4e34"] :db/ensure [:answer-field/validate]} {:db/id "q-20145" :question/id #uuid "9ee0bbb6-7fc1-5766-b761-cf4d607ded40" :question/math-academy-id "q-20145" :question/problem "Calculate the volume of the parallelepiped spanned by $\\overset{\\to }{AB}$, $\\overset{\\to }{AC}$ and $\\overset{\\to }{AD}$, given the points $A(2,1,2)$, $B(3,3,3)$, $C(-2,-1,3)$, and $D(4,1,4).$" :question/worked-solution "First, we find the displacement vectors $\\overset{\\to }{AB},$ $\\overset{\\to }{AC},$ and $\\overset{\\to }{AD}$ that span the parallelepiped:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\overset{\\to }{AB} & =b-a \\\\  & =(3i+3j+3k)-(2i+j+2k) \\\\  & =i+2j+k \\\\  & =⟨1,2,1⟩ \\\\ \\overset{\\to }{AC} & =c-a \\\\  & =(-2i-j+3k)-(2i+j+2k) \\\\  & =-4i-2j+k \\\\  & =⟨-4,-2,1⟩ \\\\ \\overset{\\to }{AD} & =d-a \\\\  & =(4i+j+4k)-(2i+j+2k) \\\\  & =2i+2k \\\\  & =⟨2,0,2⟩\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nNow, to find the volume of the parallelepiped, we need to take the absolute value of the triple product of the above vectors.\n\nComputing the triple product, we have\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\overset{\\to }{AB}\\cdot (\\overset{\\to }{AC}\\times \\overset{\\to }{AD}) & =|\\begin{aligned}1 & 2 & 1 \\\\ -4 & -2 & 1 \\\\ 2 & 0 & 2\\end{aligned}| \\\\  & =1\\cdot |\\begin{aligned}-2 & 1 \\\\ 0 & 2\\end{aligned}|-2\\cdot |\\begin{aligned}-4 & 1 \\\\ 2 & 2\\end{aligned}|+1\\cdot |\\begin{aligned}-4 & -2 \\\\ 2 & 0\\end{aligned}| \\\\  & =((-2)\\cdot 2-0\\cdot 1)-2((-4)\\cdot 2-2\\cdot 1)+((-4)\\cdot 0-2\\cdot (-2)) \\\\  & =-4+20+4 \\\\  & =20.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nTherefore, the volume of the corresponding parallelpiped spanned by $\\overset{\\to }{AB},$ $\\overset{\\to }{AC},$ and $\\overset{\\to }{AD}$ is\n\n$$\nV=|20|=20.\n$$" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/hard :question/answer-fields ["q-20145/selection"] :db/ensure [:question/validate]} {:db/id [:knowledge-point/id #uuid "57c790ad-c7fb-596c-8b60-cddd9b4e2165"] :knowledge-point/questions ["q-20145"] :db/ensure [:knowledge-point/validate]} {:db/id "q-73736/selection/c43b27454cd69f1b6f4b793e211f4f4f6e40314b87f5b1c35a69172a60fcd818" :answer/id #uuid "0617eae5-6788-5fdf-8